ersion/index.html#type-t\">Conversion.t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The constants of the type are global symbols with the default variant or with <code>variant</code>, see <code>RawData.Constants.declare_global_symbol</code></p></div></div>"}